@buildthis.bisks.net you'll need to play test this one some more glhf

The thread it's replying to, oldest first (this is the context "this" refers to):
@notjack.space: the intersection of tycoon games and automation games is woefully underserved imo

you should be able to build a factory while competing AIs build their own factories
@notjack.space: towns you sell goods to should build their own supply chains on top of your input products
@notjack.space: you should be able to buy raw materials from AI mining companies who built their own extraction facilities
@notjack.space: you should be able to transport your products to a regional hub and pay local distributor AIs to ship it to all towns in the area
@kumavis.me: @buildthis.bisks.net make it so
